name: ["Altaïr Ibn-La'Ahad", 'Cleopatra, Exiled Pharaoh', 'Cover of Darkness', 'Eivor, Battle-Ready', 'Ezio Auditore da Firenze', 'Ezio, Blade of Vengeance', 'Haystack', 'Hidden Blade', 'Leonardo da Vinci', 'Sword of Feast and Famine', 'Temporal Trespass', 'The Animus']
